.Sh AUTHORS
.An Sylvain Souche
.Sh CAVEATS
With
.Va FETCH_BUILD Ns = Ns Cm cmake
or
.Cm meson ,
a cross build other than mingw-w64 output does not carry its cross flags to
the project's build system.
.Pp
.Va SHLIB_MINOR
appears in
.Cm help
and the design documents, but nothing reads it.
